{
  "job_B9.6.2_20251003_115049": {
    "chunk_text": "se papa Bonefatius \u00feone ylcan cyning, onsendum gewritum, w\u00e6s trymmende to rihtum Hwylc ge\u00feeaht se ylca cyning mid his ealdormonnum h\u00e6bbende w\u00e6s be \u00fe\u00e6re onfengnysse Cristes \u00de\u00e6t se ylca Edwine mid his \u00feeode geleafful geworden w\u00e6s; & \u00fe\u00e6t Paulinus hine gefullade. \u00d0\u00e6t seo m\u00e6g\u00f0e Eastengla Cristes geleafan onfeng. \u00d0\u00e6t Paulinus on Lindesege m\u00e6g\u00f0e bodigende w\u00e6s Cristes geleafan. Be \u00fe\u00e6re sibbe & stillnysse Eadwines cyninges rices. Be for\u00f0fore Iustus \u00fe\u00e6s arcebiscopes: & \u00fe\u00e6t Honorius for him gecoren w\u00e6s & fram Paulino on \u00d0\u00e6tte, ofslegenum eadwine fram pendan myrcna cyninge, paulinus se bisceop w\u00e6s eft cumende to Her enda\u00f0 seo o\u00f0er boc. And her onginne\u00f0 seo \u00feridde. \u00d0\u00e6t \u00fea forman \u00e6fterfyligende Eadwines cyninges \u00feone geleafan his agenre \u00feeode besmiton: & \u00d0\u00e6t se ylca cyning biddende of Sceotta \u00feeode biscope onfeng Aidanum on naman gehatenne, & Be Aidanus life \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes. Be eauf\u00e6stnysse & wundorlicre arf\u00e6stnysse Oswaldes cyninges. \u00d0\u00e6t seo m\u00e6g\u00f0 Westseaxna, bodigendum Birino \u00feam biscope, onfeng Godes word; & be his \u00d0\u00e6tte Cantwara cyning Erconbyrht bebead deofolgyld beon toworpene : & be his dehter \u00d0\u00e6t on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe, \u00f0\u00e6r ofsl\u00e6gen w\u00e6s se cyning Oswald, gelomlicu wundurgeweorc gewordene \u00d0\u00e6t \u00fe",
